WEBVTT

00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:33.270
Hayashi-san...

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:35.660
Don't tell me...

00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:37.210
you're...

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:41.300
I ran into a woman on the street,

00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:46.570
and when I came to,
I was in a hospital with an IV.

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:49.880
I ran into someone at the convenience store

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:52.190
that I used to talk to over the phone!

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:56.840
I had Morimori-chan put it in herself!

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:11.940
Sorry about that!

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:14.690
I spilled my coffee, so I had to clean it up.

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:17.190
Oh! Are you okay?

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:20.780
Yup. Both me and my keyboard are safe!

00:02:21.550 --> 00:02:22.700
What a relief.

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:27.140
I'd feel all lonely by myself if
I couldn't talk to you anymore.

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:35.510
Me, too...

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:42.920
There's no way. Coincidences
like that don't happen.

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:46.970
Episode 5

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:46.970
Secret Triangle

00:02:48.300 --> 00:02:50.480
This is gonna be so fun!

00:02:51.050 --> 00:02:53.980
Can't wait for my date with Morimori-chan!

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:57.860
I'm surprised she actually agreed to it.

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:03.120
Well, she remembered exactly who I was.

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:07.620
So once I asked her out for some
drinks, she was happy to agree.

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.610
I'm sure you forced her into it!

00:03:09.610 --> 00:03:11.620
Forced her into promising she'd go!

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:12.370
Morioka Moriko

00:03:14.350 --> 00:03:15.380
Sakurai.

00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:18.350
All's well that ends well!

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:22.320
But it's not "all well"!
At least, not from her perspective!

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:24.380
Don't be so stiff.

00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:29.390
If you come with, you can see her, too.

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:30.380
Huh?

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:34.040
I bet you've got lots you want
to talk to her about, right?

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:35.400
Well?

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:40.150
I guess so.

00:03:41.190 --> 00:03:43.750
But wouldn't I just be in the way?

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:47.240
I mean, this is your... d-date with her.

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:49.280
Oh, I get it.

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:52.120
She gave me the okay,

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:56.170
but she turned you down
when you asked her out.

00:03:56.430 --> 00:03:58.300
Wh-What? That's not...

00:03:58.300 --> 00:04:00.810
You're just so cute, Sakura-chan!

00:04:00.810 --> 00:04:02.840
I was just joking.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:03.970
Joking?

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:08.320
I mean, you're the reason I
set this all up to begin with.

00:04:08.320 --> 00:04:09.430
Koiwai-san?

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:13.470
Not that I bothered to mention
you when I asked her out.

00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:16.080
Y-You're such a jerk...

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:25.360
Welcome!

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:34.830
That's right, I threw all my stockings out.

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:38.840
I can't let Koiwai-san see
me looking like a wreck again.

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:41.760
I'm happy I talked with Lily-san about it.

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:45.590
Just thinking about going out
for drinks had me all nervous,

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:48.580
but now I feel like I've finally relaxed some.

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:55.290
I think I've still got some foundation left.

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:57.550
My eyeshadow's probably fine, too.

00:04:58.350 --> 00:05:01.050
Oh, but my mascara might
be all clumpy by now!

00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:03.440
I wonder if I'll need any hair wax...

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:06.660
No, what am I even going
to do with this hair?

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:07.520
And my clothes?

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:08.540
My shoes?!

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:09.780
Stretched-out scrunchy LV 47

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:10.530
High school era sweatshirt LV 82

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:11.910
Undershirt with worn-out neckline LV 120

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:15.540
High school era sweatpants LV 84

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:15.540
All-weather slip-ons LV 32

00:05:15.260 --> 00:05:18.500
This is no time to relax!

00:05:23.270 --> 00:05:24.200
Um...

00:05:24.930 --> 00:05:26.380
Y-Yes?

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:29.680
We kind of got interrupted the other day.

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:31.810
I didn't even introduce myself, did I?

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:35.560
I'm Fujimoto Kazuomi. Happy to meet you.

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:40.640
M-My name is Morioka Moriko.

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:44.870
I-I'm happy to make your acquaintance.

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:45.970
Come on! No need to be so formal!

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:47.950
I'm the one who's younger.

00:05:50.440 --> 00:05:52.400
I-I'm sorry.

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:58.590
You're really funny.

00:05:58.590 --> 00:06:00.340
I'm glad we met, Morioka-san.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:03.050
Y-Yeah.

00:06:06.740 --> 00:06:09.030
You got two top tier prizes?! That's amazing!

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:11.060
If you sell them right away, you'll be rich.

00:06:11.420 --> 00:06:13.470
Someone from my guild said the same thing.

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:16.480
They said that I'd be able
to get the full set.

00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:25.500
Then, if we're on the same server,
do you want any leftover pieces I get?

00:06:26.020 --> 00:06:26.740
Huh?

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:28.820
Uh...

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:33.510
I wonder if he'll be weirded out
if he finds out I play a guy.

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:34.760
Oh, sorry.

00:06:35.820 --> 00:06:38.520
I know some people prefer to keep their
online life and real life separate.

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:40.640
Oh, n-no, that's not it!

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:44.000
Um, I play on the Calmar server.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.130
Seriously?

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:47.330
Then we might have seen
each other online before.

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:49.470
My character's called...

00:06:57.390 --> 00:07:00.100
@Home Party
LV 102   Hayashi

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:00.370
I'm done for.

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:03.160
My online life is totally over.

00:07:03.160 --> 00:07:04.270
Hayashi-kun!

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:07.980
Oh, Lilac-san.

00:07:07.980 --> 00:07:09.850
You look down.

00:07:09.850 --> 00:07:11.720
What are you doing out here?

00:07:12.100 --> 00:07:13.900
I'm waiting for someone.

00:07:13.900 --> 00:07:16.890
And I guess I just feel like
I want to hide under a rock.

00:07:16.890 --> 00:07:18.760
Oh, I know how that feels.

00:07:18.760 --> 00:07:21.220
And you can fit right in here!

00:07:24.990 --> 00:07:27.980
Now that's the stuff!

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:30.520
Are you doing a transport quest?

00:07:30.520 --> 00:07:33.430
Yup. I'm just killing some time like you are.

00:07:33.780 --> 00:07:36.180
I'm gonna go hunting with
my real life friend later!

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:37.680
With your real life friend?

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:38.740
Yup!

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:41.650
She's the same age as me and
she goes to the same university.

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:43.740
Yeah?

00:07:43.740 --> 00:07:47.890
Were you the one that got her
into playing the game?

00:07:47.890 --> 00:07:48.840
Nope.

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:53.580
We were just getting to know
each other as classmates and friends.

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:56.860
And when I told her I liked
MMOs, she said she did, too.

00:07:57.820 --> 00:08:02.000
What's more, when I finally met her in game,

00:08:02.280 --> 00:08:06.150
she was playing a guy and secretly
pretending to be a guy online.

00:08:06.910 --> 00:08:10.760
Lilac-san, you can't say it's a secret
and then completely spill the beans!

00:08:11.370 --> 00:08:14.430
So she's like me and plays a guy online.

00:08:16.420 --> 00:08:19.510
Um, did that surprise you?

00:08:19.510 --> 00:08:20.790
Surprise me?

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:27.010
Did your friend playing a guy creep
you out or make you feel weird?

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:32.150
Are you making fun of my friend?

00:08:32.830 --> 00:08:37.300
No, no! Sorry, that's not what I meant. Um...

00:08:37.300 --> 00:08:40.000
You should keep these kinds
of discussions to whispers.

00:08:42.190 --> 00:08:43.290
Kanbe-san.

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:47.670
Hayashi's got enough to worry about as is.

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:49.170
Right?

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:51.320
You do?

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:54.840
Come on, you know there
are people who freak out

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:56.930
when a guy plays a girl online or vice versa.

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:00.180
But no need to worry.

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:03.430
Lilac isn't the kind of person
who'd make fun of that. Right?

00:09:04.090 --> 00:09:07.810
Of course! People are free to
have fun however they want!

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:12.480
Oh, I see what's going on.

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:16.570
No worries! If you decide to play a
girl online, I'll fully support you!

00:09:16.770 --> 00:09:18.220
Things have been smoothed over,

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:20.760
but now there's a whole new misunderstanding!

00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:23.300
Bye-bye!

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:24.460
Bye-bye.

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:26.980
Now then...

00:09:27.990 --> 00:09:32.340
Who would have ever guessed these
kinds of coincidences actually happen...

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:32.340
Kanbe:  Now then...
Kanbe:  Who would have ever guessed these kinds of coincidences actually happen...

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:35.510
Morioka Moriko-san?

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:41.850
Morioka-san? Morioka-san?

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:46.010
Don't say my real name in game, please.

00:09:46.010 --> 00:09:47.950
Oh, yeah... my bad.

00:09:49.490 --> 00:09:50.360
Hayashi.

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:52.610
Yes?

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:57.640
Jeez, you're too old to
be this scared of a kid!

00:09:58.060 --> 00:09:59.730
I've thought for a while now

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:03.620
that you were oddly mature for your age.

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:08.150
You're so wary to talk about your
real life, and you're vague when you do.

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:15.060
But I guess I can see why now.

00:10:15.060 --> 00:10:18.260
You're a NEET in your thirties
that plays a guy online.

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:22.620
It's just as he says.

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:26.960
I'm sorry for lying

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:29.230
even though you all did so much for me.

00:10:35.670 --> 00:10:37.560
I think it's fine.

00:10:38.420 --> 00:10:40.700
Everyone enjoys the game in their own way.

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:44.350
I think whatever's fine.
Just do what you like.

00:10:44.350 --> 00:10:47.870
I mean, honestly, I just
want to avoid any trouble.

00:10:48.300 --> 00:10:51.460
But I don't think you're the kind
of person that would do anything

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:53.770
that might hurt someone else.

00:10:57.230 --> 00:10:58.740
Kanbe-san...

00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:03.130
Man, I can't believe I said something so lame!

00:11:03.130 --> 00:11:04.630
Oh, now that I think about it...

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:08.540
Does Lily know about this?

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:09.690
No.

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:13.240
It's probably best if I'm
honest with her, right?

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:15.150
Because she's your partner?

00:11:15.490 --> 00:11:17.900
Yes, and...

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:21.490
With how she looks
and how kindhearted she is,

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:24.910
Popularity of a support role

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:24.150
surely you can imagine that she
has to deal with creeps sometimes.

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:31.670
I was thinking if she knew I was a
woman, too, maybe she'd be relieved.

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:37.220
Hayashi, the reason you originally
said you were a university student

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:40.360
is because there's part of your real
life you don't want to talk about, right?

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:42.570
That's true.

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:44.430
I think that, if you don't want to,

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:46.880
then there's no reason to go out
of your way to say anything.

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:49.710
We all tell lies and have our own secrets.

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:52.440
That's an MMO for you, right?

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:54.440
Yes.

00:11:55.120 --> 00:12:00.070
For the time being, please don't tell
anyone that you and I know each other.

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:02.920
It would be a pain to explain
everything anyway.

00:12:04.260 --> 00:12:07.980
And I won't tell anyone that you're a woman.

00:12:08.560 --> 00:12:11.380
You should be the one
to decide things for yourself.

00:12:12.780 --> 00:12:15.800
But there is one thing
I want to warn you about.

00:12:18.580 --> 00:12:19.990
Even if she's your partner,

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:23.970
I think you're better off not asking for
too much real life advice from Lily.

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:49.320
Wow, these bags are horrid.

00:12:49.320 --> 00:12:51.790
More like the whole package is horrid!

00:12:55.850 --> 00:13:00.630
Man, what kind of clothes are you even
supposed to wear when you go out for a drink?

00:13:04.570 --> 00:13:07.070
I want to ask what Lily-san thinks.

00:13:07.490 --> 00:13:08.450
But...

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:11.370
Even if she's your partner,

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:14.820
I think you're better off not asking for
too much real life advice from Lily.

00:13:17.620 --> 00:13:21.620
But I already talked to her about
going out to this drinking thing.

00:13:22.350 --> 00:13:24.540
So asking just a little more is fine, right?

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:29.160
An outfit for going out for a drink?

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:31.150
That's right.

00:13:31.150 --> 00:13:33.320
I'm kind of dense when it comes to fashion.

00:13:34.030 --> 00:13:38.290
Um, speaking of, when
exactly is your night out?

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:40.810
Well, actually, it's tomorrow.

00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:43.090
Tomorrow?

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:46.430
I thought their date was
the day after tomorrow.

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:49.820
Koiwai-san's on a business
trip to Osaka tomorrow.

00:13:49.820 --> 00:13:52.680
I'm sure he said he won't
be back until the day after.

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:56.340
So he's not Morioka-san after all?

00:13:58.080 --> 00:14:02.060
I think anything neat
and tidy will work fine.

00:14:02.060 --> 00:14:04.210
This time of year,
I guess you'd go with, let's see...

00:14:04.890 --> 00:14:07.700
Something simple like a shirt and cardigan.

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:09.820
I see.

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:11.570
So while we're on the topic,

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:15.110
what kind of clothing would a woman
wear in this kind of situation?

00:14:15.490 --> 00:14:16.120
Huh?

00:14:16.640 --> 00:14:18.830
Sounds like you two are having fun.

00:14:23.280 --> 00:14:24.880
Count me in.

00:14:25.940 --> 00:14:27.170
All right, Hayashi?

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:34.170
Going out drinking with someone
you used to work with?

00:14:35.170 --> 00:14:39.660
I think Kanbe-san can probably help
you more with this than I can.

00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:41.810
You're both young men, after all.

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:44.820
Th-That's true.

00:14:45.430 --> 00:14:48.450
So, going back to the
question Hayashi just asked,

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:51.320
how do you dress when you
go out for a few drinks, Lily?

00:14:52.630 --> 00:14:54.830
What? Me?

00:14:57.570 --> 00:14:59.510
Thank you, Kanbe-san!

00:15:00.880 --> 00:15:04.430
Jeez, right after I warned her.

00:15:05.020 --> 00:15:06.170
Someone's whispering me?

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:10.180
Lily:  Right after I thought I changed the topic, why did you bring it back up again?!
Lily:  There's no way I can tell him I'm a guy in real life!

00:15:07.140 --> 00:15:12.100
"Right after I thought I changed the topic,
why did you bring it back up again?"

00:15:12.100 --> 00:15:15.480
"There's no way I can tell
him I'm a guy in real life!"

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:19.880
I'm only asking because it sounds
like Hayashi wants to know!

00:15:19.880 --> 00:15:23.290
Just tell him how you
would like to see a girl dress!

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:25.850
Hmm...

00:15:25.850 --> 00:15:30.250
A blouse and a skirt? Plus a
cardigan or something, I guess?

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:32.040
That's a real help!

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:33.950
What about hairstyle?

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:37.140
Y-You want to dig deeper?

00:15:39.090 --> 00:15:41.070
How about long with a bit
of a wave or something?

00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:42.800
I prefer short hair!

00:15:42.800 --> 00:15:43.680
Huh?

00:15:43.680 --> 00:15:45.610
You don't like long hair?

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:49.210
It's not that I don't like it, but it's
easier to take care of if it's short, right?

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:54.470
A girl's long hair is the
very image of romance!

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:57.680
It's cute and overflowing with possibility!

00:15:57.680 --> 00:16:00.700
You're not fooling me
with arguments like that!

00:16:00.700 --> 00:16:02.640
I know people who've grown
out their hair because

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:04.520
it's too much trouble for
them to style every day!

00:16:04.850 --> 00:16:08.470
Those are people who just
don't take care of their hair!

00:16:08.470 --> 00:16:11.690
A true woman overcomes the trials
of taking care of her hair every day,

00:16:11.690 --> 00:16:13.670
and ups her femininity by doing so!

00:16:13.670 --> 00:16:15.360
Don't you think so, Hayashi-san?

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:16.320
Huh?!

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:18.460
I'm sorry, Lily-san!

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:23.040
Hayashi's player is the type of person
who has long hair and doesn't take care of it!

00:16:28.290 --> 00:16:30.250
How would you like your hair today?

00:16:32.210 --> 00:16:34.370
Um...

00:16:35.670 --> 00:16:39.640
Short hair is hard because you have to style
it every day with gel or something, right?

00:16:40.940 --> 00:16:42.840
That's not true.

00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:45.670
There are lots of options, like just
dabbing a bit of wax on the ends.

00:16:47.130 --> 00:16:50.820
Dabbing a bit of wax on the ends?

00:16:51.680 --> 00:16:54.260
Well, let's see...

00:16:54.930 --> 00:16:59.410
I think long hair would look better
on you than short hair.

00:17:02.520 --> 00:17:04.040
Short is best!

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:05.790
Long is beautiful!

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:08.670
Long hair looks like it suits you best!

00:17:09.480 --> 00:17:10.990
Two to one.

00:17:10.990 --> 00:17:13.800
And I don't have the courage
to go all the way with short hair.

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:18.240
Can you just do something
around medium length?

00:17:18.240 --> 00:17:19.050
Sure!

00:17:19.770 --> 00:17:21.790
That'll be 5,500 yen!

00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:25.410
I could've had eleven loot boxes for that.

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:36.450
Blouse

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:36.450
And this is thirteen loot boxes.

00:17:41.170 --> 00:17:43.450
Another eighteen.

00:17:45.530 --> 00:17:46.580
And here we have...

00:17:47.310 --> 00:17:49.840
No, I have to stop converting these numbers.

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:55.260
Total

00:17:52.190 --> 00:17:54.240
Real life spending: complete!

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:07.900
Yoshimura Presentation meeting 13:00-15:00

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:07.900
Koiwai Osaka trip Wed-Thu (Scheduled back Thursday evening)

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:07.900
Sakamoto

00:18:14.240 --> 00:18:18.280
That drink you're having with
Morioka-san isn't today, right?

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:20.030
It's tomorrow.

00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:22.310
I don't think I'll be back
home until the afternoon.

00:18:23.380 --> 00:18:24.810
That's right.

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:28.290
I'm sure you already knew that, Sakura-chan.

00:18:28.510 --> 00:18:30.030
So what's with the call?

00:18:30.950 --> 00:18:32.670
Are you just that lonely withou—

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:45.180
It's been so long that I've lost my touch.

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:06.860
Offline, as expected.

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:14.700
Even going into the city in real
life makes me feel nervous.

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:19.240
I came too early.

00:19:23.420 --> 00:19:25.510
Hayashi-kun isn't online tonight.

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:27.920
Oh, he said he was going out for drinks.

00:19:27.920 --> 00:19:29.650
That's unusual.

00:19:29.650 --> 00:19:33.580
Though, I guess for a university student,
going out for drinks is the norm.

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.090
Yeah.

00:19:51.180 --> 00:19:53.370
Coincidences like that don't happen.

00:19:53.930 --> 00:19:55.250
They just don't.

00:19:55.700 --> 00:19:58.860
But if Hayashi-san is<i> Morioka-san,</i>

00:20:00.110 --> 00:20:01.350
then right now...

00:20:06.860 --> 00:20:08.770
All right then, let's dive in!

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:11.020
Sorry! Something sudden
came up so I'm logging off!

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:12.300
Huh?

00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:15.820
Lilac, can you cover healing?

00:20:15.820 --> 00:20:16.850
Wha?

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:18.850
Me?

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:22.860
Maybe I should contact Koiwai-san.

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:26.210
But he might already be on his way here.

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:29.190
What, you took me seriously?

00:20:29.570 --> 00:20:31.910
Haven't you ever heard of lip service?

00:20:33.390 --> 00:20:35.990
What'll I do if he says that?

00:20:37.390 --> 00:20:39.350
I ran out the door in a hurry,

00:20:39.870 --> 00:20:42.690
but what am I going to do if
Morioka-san is actually there?

00:20:54.740 --> 00:20:55.940
That's long enough, right?

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:58.210
I've already waited an hour.

00:21:03.380 --> 00:21:04.160
She's not here.

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:05.570
Yeah...

00:21:07.110 --> 00:21:07.950
Of course not.

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:41.830
Morioka-san!

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:51.130
Sakurai-san?

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:27.870
Were you looking forward
to our date that much?

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:40.070
Next Episode

00:23:27.870 --> 00:23:30.880
My turn on stage is over with this.

00:23:30.880 --> 00:23:32.470
I think you look lovely.

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:35.970
Even though I know he's just being polite,
it still makes my heart flutter.

00:23:35.180 --> 00:23:40.150
Episode 6
I'm So Embarrassed I Could Die!

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:39.390
Episode 6, "I'm So Embarrassed I Could Die!"
